  THE PROBLEM WITH THAT LEVER, stated before it is tested: every class that can be measured with Gaia-class
  astrometry lives within ~1 kpc of the Sun.  Molecular clouds reach 4-12 kpc but only in projection and
  with a metallicity/X_CO gradient running the OTHER way (k03); globular clusters reach 150 kpc but are
  internally DENSER than the local field for R_GC < 15 kpc, so they leave the solar-circle end untested.

